{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D6B8GfPaCZJ4VSh9hdSzfg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — vla-ssd\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: CoRL 2026\n5\t- Deadline: Abstract May 26, Paper May 29\n6\t- Format: 8 pages + references\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n9\t\n10\t1. **Vision Encoder Dominance**: VLA 中 action-relevant 表征结构由 frozen vision encoder（SigLIP）决定。SigLIP+projector 的 RSA 与 action structure 的相关性（ρ=0.615）远高于完整 VLA（ρ≈0.501, image_mean 聚合）和 standalone vision model（DINOv2 ρ=0.388）。\n11\t2. **LLM Redistributes Action-Relevant Structure (Training-Dependent)**: LLM 降解 distributed image token 的 **geometric alignment**（RSA: 0.615→0.501）和 functional capacity（R²: 0.706→0.683, p=0.001），但 global structure 保留（CKA 单调上升）。**训练后** LLM 学会将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（trained R²=0.731 > projector 0.706, p=0.001），但 **untrained LLM 做不到**（untrained readout best=0.686 < projector 0.706）。Readout concentration 是 learned behavior，不是架构固有属性。\n12\t3. **Training: Routing Without Creating**: VLA fine-tuning 不改变 distributed representation structure（image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20），但提升 readout concentration（trained last_preaction 0.731 >> untrained 0.686，Δ=0.045, bootstrap CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001）。Instruction input 对两者均无影响。综合解读：**Training 的贡献是学习信息路由（routing），而非注入新的 action knowledge（creating）**。\n13\t\n14\t## Paper 主数值基准（image_mean 聚合，公平对比）\n15\t\n16\t| Model / Condition | RSA (image_mean) | Notes |\n17\t|---|---|---|\n18\t| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.615** | Smoking gun, LLM input |\n19\t| VLA trained with-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23 |\n20\t| VLA untrained with-inst | 0.485 | Peak L23 |\n21\t| VLA trained no-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23, identical to with-inst |\n22\t| VLA untrained no-inst | 0.482 | Peak L29 |\n23\t| DINO-V2 | 0.388 | Vision-only baseline |\n24\t\n25\tlast_preaction 数值（trained 0.488, untrained 0.485）放 supplementary 作为 robustness check。\n26\t\n27\t## Functional Probe 数值基准\n28\t\n29\t### Raw Action Prediction R²\n30\t\n31\t| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n32\t|---|---|---|\n33\t| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.706** | Vision encoder output |\n34\t| VLA Trained image_mean L19 | 0.683 | image tokens degraded — ✅ bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 vs Proj |\n35\t| **Trained last_preaction L19** | **0.731** | readout concentration (p=0.001 vs projector) |\n36\t| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.714 | Architecture-intrinsic |\n37\t| **Untrained last_preaction L32** | **0.686** | < projector (0.706) → redistribution requires training (D034) |\n38\t| DINO-V2 (LIBERO-Goal) | **0.712** | ✅ cls_token; DINO ≈ Proj (Δ=0.005, CI=[-0.008, 0.019], p=0.22, n.s.) |\n39\t\n40\t**Three-way ordering**: DINO (0.712) ≈ Projector (0.706) > LLM image_mean (0.683)\n41\t\n42\t**重要发现**: DINO 与 Projector 在 action decodability (R²) 上无显著差异，但 RSA 几何对齐差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 action information 的 presence（probe 可解码）与 geometric alignment（表征空间结构匹配 action 空间结构）是不同维度。论文需区分这两个层面。\n43\t\n44\t### Action-Delta Prediction R²\n45\t\n46\t| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n47\t|---|---|---|\n48\t| VLA Trained image_mean L14 | 0.122 | |\n49\t| SigLIP+Projector | 0.118 | ≈ LLM, CI includes 0 (p=0.04) |\n50\t| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.117 | ≈ projector ≈ LLM |\n51\t| DINO (LIBERO-Goal) | 0.100 | action_delta probe from v2 |\n52\t| DINO (MVP-2 LIBERO-10) | 0.061 | 2× lower than projector/LLM |\n53\t\n54\t**Delta 维度结论**：三者几乎相同（~0.12），远 > DINO (0.06-0.10)。支持 vision encoder dominance（所有 action-delta info 追溯到 SigLIP）。Delta last_preaction 缺失（待补）。\n55\t\n56\t### 聚合口径依赖性（论文必须如实讨论）\n57\t\n58\t| Comparison | image_mean | last_preaction |\n59\t|---|---|---|\n60\t| Raw action: Proj vs LLM | Proj wins (+0.023, CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001) | LLM wins (+0.025, p=0.001) |\n61\t| Delta: Proj vs LLM | ≈ tie (−0.003, CI includes 0) | TBD |\n62\t\n63\t主文用 image_mean（公平聚合），last_preaction 放 supplementary。但必须讨论聚合口径对结论的影响。\n64\t\n65\t## Story Spine\n66\t\n67\t- **Problem**: VLAs 通过 fine-tuning LLM on robot data 实现 impressive performance，但 action-relevant 表征从何而来？业界隐性假设 fine-tuning 注入 new representational knowledge，但无系统性验证。\n68\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Grant et al. 2026 从 behavioral level 发现 visual pathway dominates，但未做 representational decomposition。无人测量过 VLA 各组件（vision encoder / projector / LLM）对 action-relevant 表征结构的独立贡献。\n69\t- **Our framing**: 首次对 VLA 进行系统性 representational + functional analysis——组件级分解 + per-layer probing + action prediction probes，定量揭示 action-relevant 结构的来源和 LLM 对其的变换。发现 vision encoder 是 action information 的通用源头（DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²，但 VL pretraining 赋予 geometric alignment）。LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征但通过**训练依赖的** attention 机制将信号聚合到 readout token——training 教会 routing 而非 creating new knowledge。\n70\t- **Headline result**: \"The frozen vision encoder provides action-relevant representations (RSA ρ=0.615, action probe R²=0.706) that the LLM degrades at the image-token level (R²→0.683) but reconcentrates into a readout token (R²=0.731). This reconcentration is training-dependent (untrained readout R²=0.686 < projector 0.706), while distributed representation structure remains training-invariant (image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, p=0.20). Language instructions affect neither.\"\n71\t- **✅ All core evidence complete.** P1 remaining: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control, plan_010 LIBERO-Spatial (P2).\n72\t\n73\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n74\t\n75\t### C1: 单一 VLA 架构（OpenVLA）泛化性\n76\t- **应对**: Scope 明确限定为 \"OpenVLA-class architecture\"。OpenVLA 是最广泛使用的开源 VLA 之一，findings 对该架构族直接适用。Discussion 中讨论扩展到其他架构的预期。\n77\t- **实验**: 无需额外实验，Limitations 明确标注。\n78\t\n79\t### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\n80\t- **问题**: SigLIP 是 image-text contrastive pretrained，DINOv2 是 self-supervised。RSA gap 可能来自 language-aware pretraining 而非纯 vision encoder 质量。\n81\t- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。新发现加强此论点：DINO 与 Projector 在 action R² 上无差异（0.712 vs 0.706, p=0.22），但 RSA 几何差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 VL pretraining 的贡献在于 geometric alignment 而非 information content。\n82\t- **实验**: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control (P1)。区分 \"use VL-pretrained encoder\" vs \"use SigLIP specifically\"。\n83\t\n84\t### C3: LLM 对 action structure 的作用机制\n85\t- **问题**: LLM 到底做了什么？为什么 image token RSA 降低？\n86\t- **应对**: Functional probe 揭示机制——LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征（R² 0.706→0.683, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037]）但通过 self-attention 将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（R² 0.731）。这是 next-token prediction architecture 的自然行为：信息从 context tokens 流向 prediction position。Per-layer curve 的非单调模式（中间层部分恢复）与此一致。\n87\t- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe (Done) + plan_003 per-layer curve (Done)。\n88\t\n89\t### C4: Grant 2026 checkpoint 差异\n90\t- **问题**: Grant 用 OFT fine-tuned，我们用 standard fine-tuning checkpoint。\n91\t- **应对**: 我们用 standard fine-tuning 是更强的测试——如果完全不同的 LLM 权重（random init vs pretrained+finetuned，cos_sim≈0.2）都不改变表征，OFT 更不会。Related Work 明确区分。\n92\t\n93\t### C5: Practical implications / 功能验证\n94\t- **问题**: RSA alignment ≠ task performance。Practical implications?\n95\t- **应对**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe 完成——projector R²=0.706 vs LLM image_mean 0.683（gap=0.023, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001）。LLM readout token R²=0.731 > projector（p=0.001）。Delta probe: projector < LLM 但不显著（CI 含 0）。三个建议：(1) Vision encoder pretraining 是 action info 关键；(2) Image-level tasks 用 projector output；(3) LLM 的价值在于 readout concentration。\n96\t- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 Done（含 bootstrap CI + DINO 三方对比）。\n97\t\n98\t### C6: 聚合方式伪影（已解决）\n99\t- **问题**: SigLIP 用 mean pooling，VLA 用 last token，比较不公平。\n100\t- **应对**: ✅ 已用 image_mean 聚合验证。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501，仍远低于 SigLIP 0.615（gap=0.114）。两种聚合方式结果一致（last_preaction 0.488 vs image_mean 0.501）。主文使用 image_mean 保证公平，last_preaction 放 supplementary。\n101\t\n102\t## Key Evidence Inventory\n103\t\n104\t| Evidence | Claim | Status |\n105\t|----------|-------|--------|\n106\t| SigLIP+Projector RSA=0.615 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n107\t| Full VLA RSA ≈ 0.501 (image_mean, 4 conditions) | C2, C3 | ✅ Done |\n108\t| DINO RSA=0.388 | C1 | ✅ Done |\n109\t| 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks: trained ≈ untrained | C3 | ✅ Done |\n110\t| Instruction ablation Δ=0.004 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n111\t| 2×2 matrix Bootstrap CI includes 0 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n112\t| Output head analysis: SigLIP+projector frozen | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n113\t| Per-layer RSA degradation curve | C2 | ✅ Done — non-monotonic, Proj→L1 primary drop |\n114\t| VLA image_mean RSA (aggregation robustness) | C2 | ✅ Done — 0.501 vs SigLIP 0.615, gap=0.114 |\n115\t| Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean) | C3 | ✅ Done — CI includes 0, invariance holds |\n116\t| Functional action probe: Proj 0.706 vs LLM img_mean 0.683 vs readout 0.731 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done — bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 |\n117\t| DINO action probe on LIBERO-Goal | C1 | ✅ Done — R²=0.712, DINO ≈ Proj (p=0.22) |\n118\t| Action-delta probe: Proj 0.118 < LLM 0.122, CI includes 0 | C2 | ✅ Done — BELOW but not significant |\n119\t| No-inst image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 = with-inst, untrained 0.482 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n120\t| Untrained last_preaction: L32 R²=0.686 < projector 0.706 | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — redistribution is training-dependent (D034) |\n121\t| Untrained vs trained last_preaction bootstrap CI | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — Δ=0.045, CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001 |\n122\t| Random instruction control: normal 0.489, random 0.484, shuffled 0.483, empty 0.472 — all within ±0.017 | C3 | ✅ Done — instruction content invariant (plan_008) |\n123\t| CLIP-ViT pretraining control | C1, C2 | 📋 P1 planned (plan_012) |\n124\t| CKA verification: ordering reversal — CKA untrained > trained > proj > DINO | C1, C2, C7 | ✅ Done — RSA-CKA dissociation (plan_009) |\n125\t| LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark | C1, C2, C3 | 📋 P2 planned (plan_010) |\n126\t\n127\t### C7: RSA vs CKA metric dependency — 排序反转（plan_009 已完成）\n128\t- **问题**: CKA 不仅缩小 gap，还**反转排序**。RSA: projector > trained > untrained > DINO。CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO。\n129\t- **数据**:\n130\t  - CKA vs actions: untrained L23 (0.089) > trained L23 (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\n131\t  - CKA per-layer trained image_mean: L0=0.081 **单调上升** to L32=0.098（与 RSA 的非单调模式不同）\n132\t  - CKA last_preaction: L32=0.127（最高，支持 redistribution — readout concentration）\n133\t  - CKA_RDM: last_preaction (0.290) > projector (0.257) ≈ trained (0.260) > DINO (0.241)（部分一致）\n134\t- **应对**: 论文正面讨论作为 finding。关键区分：\n135\t  - RSA 捕捉 **local geometric alignment**（representation 距离结构是否匹配 action 距离结构）→ LLM 降解\n136\t  - CKA 捕捉 **global structure preservation**（整体变换后结构是否保留）→ LLM 保留或改善\n137\t  - **Claim 2 必须明确限定为 \"geometric (RSA) degradation\"**，不能泛化为 \"representation quality degradation\"\n138\t  - CKA last_preaction 最高 (0.127) 与 redistribution narrative 一致\n139\t- **实验**: ✅ plan_009 Done。\n140\t\n141\t## Literature Positioning\n142\t\n143\t- **Grant et al. 2026**: Behavioral level \"visual pathway dominates\" → 我们 representational level 确认 + 定量组件分解\n144\t- **Fang 2025**: \"Fine-tuning erodes VLM reasoning\" → 我们发现 LLM step 本身（不只是 fine-tuning）就降低 visual structure\n145\t- **Hou 2026 (LangGap) / Fei 2025 (LIBERO-Plus)**: \"VLAs ignore language instructions\" → 我们从 representation level 解释 why：instruction text 对表征结构无实质影响\n146\t- **Haon et al. (CoRL 2025)**: Mechanistic interpretability + activation steering on OpenVLA — same venue, same model. Must discuss: their sparse semantic directions vs our geometric analysis are complementary views\n147\t- **Lu et al. 2025**: Linear probing on OpenVLA hidden layers >90% accuracy — methodologically closest, must differentiate (component decomposition vs layer probing)\n148\t- **Rizzardo et al. 2026**: Feature observability/controllability in VLAs\n149\t- **Swann et al. 2026**: SAE-based OpenVLA interpretability\n150\t- **Molinari et al. 2025**: Emergent world representations in OpenVLA\n151\t- **Karamcheti et al. 2024 (Prismatic)**: OpenVLA's architectural foundation, must cite\n152\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b183a6b-c63b-4393-92da-16558ac7b845","uuid":"e932dffa-fce4-461a-bb08-b8307c6064f2","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:32:41.962Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T011810/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — vla-ssd\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: CoRL 2026\n- Deadline: Abstract May 26, Paper May 29\n- Format: 8 pages + references\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n\n1. **Vision Encoder Dominance**: VLA 中 action-relevant 表征结构由 frozen vision encoder（SigLIP）决定。SigLIP+projector 的 RSA 与 action structure 的相关性（ρ=0.615）远高于完整 VLA（ρ≈0.501, image_mean 聚合）和 standalone vision model（DINOv2 ρ=0.388）。\n2. **LLM Redistributes Action-Relevant Structure (Training-Dependent)**: LLM 降解 distributed image token 的 **geometric alignment**（RSA: 0.615→0.501）和 functional capacity（R²: 0.706→0.683, p=0.001），但 global structure 保留（CKA 单调上升）。**训练后** LLM 学会将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（trained R²=0.731 > projector 0.706, p=0.001），但 **untrained LLM 做不到**（untrained readout best=0.686 < projector 0.706）。Readout concentration 是 learned behavior，不是架构固有属性。\n3. **Training: Routing Without Creating**: VLA fine-tuning 不改变 distributed representation structure（image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20），但提升 readout concentration（trained last_preaction 0.731 >> untrained 0.686，Δ=0.045, bootstrap CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001）。Instruction input 对两者均无影响。综合解读：**Training 的贡献是学习信息路由（routing），而非注入新的 action knowledge（creating）**。\n\n## Paper 主数值基准（image_mean 聚合，公平对比）\n\n| Model / Condition | RSA (image_mean) | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.615** | Smoking gun, LLM input |\n| VLA trained with-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23 |\n| VLA untrained with-inst | 0.485 | Peak L23 |\n| VLA trained no-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23, identical to with-inst |\n| VLA untrained no-inst | 0.482 | Peak L29 |\n| DINO-V2 | 0.388 | Vision-only baseline |\n\nlast_preaction 数值（trained 0.488, untrained 0.485）放 supplementary 作为 robustness check。\n\n## Functional Probe 数值基准\n\n### Raw Action Prediction R²\n\n| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.706** | Vision encoder output |\n| VLA Trained image_mean L19 | 0.683 | image tokens degraded — ✅ bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 vs Proj |\n| **Trained last_preaction L19** | **0.731** | readout concentration (p=0.001 vs projector) |\n| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.714 | Architecture-intrinsic |\n| **Untrained last_preaction L32** | **0.686** | < projector (0.706) → redistribution requires training (D034) |\n| DINO-V2 (LIBERO-Goal) | **0.712** | ✅ cls_token; DINO ≈ Proj (Δ=0.005, CI=[-0.008, 0.019], p=0.22, n.s.) |\n\n**Three-way ordering**: DINO (0.712) ≈ Projector (0.706) > LLM image_mean (0.683)\n\n**重要发现**: DINO 与 Projector 在 action decodability (R²) 上无显著差异，但 RSA 几何对齐差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 action information 的 presence（probe 可解码）与 geometric alignment（表征空间结构匹配 action 空间结构）是不同维度。论文需区分这两个层面。\n\n### Action-Delta Prediction R²\n\n| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| VLA Trained image_mean L14 | 0.122 | |\n| SigLIP+Projector | 0.118 | ≈ LLM, CI includes 0 (p=0.04) |\n| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.117 | ≈ projector ≈ LLM |\n| DINO (LIBERO-Goal) | 0.100 | action_delta probe from v2 |\n| DINO (MVP-2 LIBERO-10) | 0.061 | 2× lower than projector/LLM |\n\n**Delta 维度结论**：三者几乎相同（~0.12），远 > DINO (0.06-0.10)。支持 vision encoder dominance（所有 action-delta info 追溯到 SigLIP）。Delta last_preaction 缺失（待补）。\n\n### 聚合口径依赖性（论文必须如实讨论）\n\n| Comparison | image_mean | last_preaction |\n|---|---|---|\n| Raw action: Proj vs LLM | Proj wins (+0.023, CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001) | LLM wins (+0.025, p=0.001) |\n| Delta: Proj vs LLM | ≈ tie (−0.003, CI includes 0) | TBD |\n\n主文用 image_mean（公平聚合），last_preaction 放 supplementary。但必须讨论聚合口径对结论的影响。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: VLAs 通过 fine-tuning LLM on robot data 实现 impressive performance，但 action-relevant 表征从何而来？业界隐性假设 fine-tuning 注入 new representational knowledge，但无系统性验证。\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Grant et al. 2026 从 behavioral level 发现 visual pathway dominates，但未做 representational decomposition。无人测量过 VLA 各组件（vision encoder / projector / LLM）对 action-relevant 表征结构的独立贡献。\n- **Our framing**: 首次对 VLA 进行系统性 representational + functional analysis——组件级分解 + per-layer probing + action prediction probes，定量揭示 action-relevant 结构的来源和 LLM 对其的变换。发现 vision encoder 是 action information 的通用源头（DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²，但 VL pretraining 赋予 geometric alignment）。LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征但通过**训练依赖的** attention 机制将信号聚合到 readout token——training 教会 routing 而非 creating new knowledge。\n- **Headline result**: \"The frozen vision encoder provides action-relevant representations (RSA ρ=0.615, action probe R²=0.706) that the LLM degrades at the image-token level (R²→0.683) but reconcentrates into a readout token (R²=0.731). This reconcentration is training-dependent (untrained readout R²=0.686 < projector 0.706), while distributed representation structure remains training-invariant (image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, p=0.20). Language instructions affect neither.\"\n- **✅ All core evidence complete.** P1 remaining: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control, plan_010 LIBERO-Spatial (P2).\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n### C1: 单一 VLA 架构（OpenVLA）泛化性\n- **应对**: Scope 明确限定为 \"OpenVLA-class architecture\"。OpenVLA 是最广泛使用的开源 VLA 之一，findings 对该架构族直接适用。Discussion 中讨论扩展到其他架构的预期。\n- **实验**: 无需额外实验，Limitations 明确标注。\n\n### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\n- **问题**: SigLIP 是 image-text contrastive pretrained，DINOv2 是 self-supervised。RSA gap 可能来自 language-aware pretraining 而非纯 vision encoder 质量。\n- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。新发现加强此论点：DINO 与 Projector 在 action R² 上无差异（0.712 vs 0.706, p=0.22），但 RSA 几何差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 VL pretraining 的贡献在于 geometric alignment 而非 information content。\n- **实验**: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control (P1)。区分 \"use VL-pretrained encoder\" vs \"use SigLIP specifically\"。\n\n### C3: LLM 对 action structure 的作用机制\n- **问题**: LLM 到底做了什么？为什么 image token RSA 降低？\n- **应对**: Functional probe 揭示机制——LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征（R² 0.706→0.683, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037]）但通过 self-attention 将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（R² 0.731）。这是 next-token prediction architecture 的自然行为：信息从 context tokens 流向 prediction position。Per-layer curve 的非单调模式（中间层部分恢复）与此一致。\n- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe (Done) + plan_003 per-layer curve (Done)。\n\n### C4: Grant 2026 checkpoint 差异\n- **问题**: Grant 用 OFT fine-tuned，我们用 standard fine-tuning checkpoint。\n- **应对**: 我们用 standard fine-tuning 是更强的测试——如果完全不同的 LLM 权重（random init vs pretrained+finetuned，cos_sim≈0.2）都不改变表征，OFT 更不会。Related Work 明确区分。\n\n### C5: Practical implications / 功能验证\n- **问题**: RSA alignment ≠ task performance。Practical implications?\n- **应对**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe 完成——projector R²=0.706 vs LLM image_mean 0.683（gap=0.023, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001）。LLM readout token R²=0.731 > projector（p=0.001）。Delta probe: projector < LLM 但不显著（CI 含 0）。三个建议：(1) Vision encoder pretraining 是 action info 关键；(2) Image-level tasks 用 projector output；(3) LLM 的价值在于 readout concentration。\n- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 Done（含 bootstrap CI + DINO 三方对比）。\n\n### C6: 聚合方式伪影（已解决）\n- **问题**: SigLIP 用 mean pooling，VLA 用 last token，比较不公平。\n- **应对**: ✅ 已用 image_mean 聚合验证。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501，仍远低于 SigLIP 0.615（gap=0.114）。两种聚合方式结果一致（last_preaction 0.488 vs image_mean 0.501）。主文使用 image_mean 保证公平，last_preaction 放 supplementary。\n\n## Key Evidence Inventory\n\n| Evidence | Claim | Status |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| SigLIP+Projector RSA=0.615 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n| Full VLA RSA ≈ 0.501 (image_mean, 4 conditions) | C2, C3 | ✅ Done |\n| DINO RSA=0.388 | C1 | ✅ Done |\n| 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks: trained ≈ untrained | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| Instruction ablation Δ=0.004 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| 2×2 matrix Bootstrap CI includes 0 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| Output head analysis: SigLIP+projector frozen | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n| Per-layer RSA degradation curve | C2 | ✅ Done — non-monotonic, Proj→L1 primary drop |\n| VLA image_mean RSA (aggregation robustness) | C2 | ✅ Done — 0.501 vs SigLIP 0.615, gap=0.114 |\n| Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean) | C3 | ✅ Done — CI includes 0, invariance holds |\n| Functional action probe: Proj 0.706 vs LLM img_mean 0.683 vs readout 0.731 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done — bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 |\n| DINO action probe on LIBERO-Goal | C1 | ✅ Done — R²=0.712, DINO ≈ Proj (p=0.22) |\n| Action-delta probe: Proj 0.118 < LLM 0.122, CI includes 0 | C2 | ✅ Done — BELOW but not significant |\n| No-inst image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 = with-inst, untrained 0.482 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| Untrained last_preaction: L32 R²=0.686 < projector 0.706 | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — redistribution is training-dependent (D034) |\n| Untrained vs trained last_preaction bootstrap CI | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — Δ=0.045, CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001 |\n| Random instruction control: normal 0.489, random 0.484, shuffled 0.483, empty 0.472 — all within ±0.017 | C3 | ✅ Done — instruction content invariant (plan_008) |\n| CLIP-ViT pretraining control | C1, C2 | 📋 P1 planned (plan_012) |\n| CKA verification: ordering reversal — CKA untrained > trained > proj > DINO | C1, C2, C7 | ✅ Done — RSA-CKA dissociation (plan_009) |\n| LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark | C1, C2, C3 | 📋 P2 planned (plan_010) |\n\n### C7: RSA vs CKA metric dependency — 排序反转（plan_009 已完成）\n- **问题**: CKA 不仅缩小 gap，还**反转排序**。RSA: projector > trained > untrained > DINO。CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO。\n- **数据**:\n  - CKA vs actions: untrained L23 (0.089) > trained L23 (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\n  - CKA per-layer trained image_mean: L0=0.081 **单调上升** to L32=0.098（与 RSA 的非单调模式不同）\n  - CKA last_preaction: L32=0.127（最高，支持 redistribution — readout concentration）\n  - CKA_RDM: last_preaction (0.290) > projector (0.257) ≈ trained (0.260) > DINO (0.241)（部分一致）\n- **应对**: 论文正面讨论作为 finding。关键区分：\n  - RSA 捕捉 **local geometric alignment**（representation 距离结构是否匹配 action 距离结构）→ LLM 降解\n  - CKA 捕捉 **global structure preservation**（整体变换后结构是否保留）→ LLM 保留或改善\n  - **Claim 2 必须明确限定为 \"geometric (RSA) degradation\"**，不能泛化为 \"representation quality degradation\"\n  - CKA last_preaction 最高 (0.127) 与 redistribution narrative 一致\n- **实验**: ✅ plan_009 Done。\n\n## Literature Positioning\n\n- **Grant et al. 2026**: Behavioral level \"visual pathway dominates\" → 我们 representational level 确认 + 定量组件分解\n- **Fang 2025**: \"Fine-tuning erodes VLM reasoning\" → 我们发现 LLM step 本身（不只是 fine-tuning）就降低 visual structure\n- **Hou 2026 (LangGap) / Fei 2025 (LIBERO-Plus)**: \"VLAs ignore language instructions\" → 我们从 representation level 解释 why：instruction text 对表征结构无实质影响\n- **Haon et al. (CoRL 2025)**: Mechanistic interpretability + activation steering on OpenVLA — same venue, same model. Must discuss: their sparse semantic directions vs our geometric analysis are complementary views\n- **Lu et al. 2025**: Linear probing on OpenVLA hidden layers >90% accuracy — methodologically closest, must differentiate (component decomposition vs layer probing)\n- **Rizzardo et al. 2026**: Feature observability/controllability in VLAs\n- **Swann et al. 2026**: SAE-based OpenVLA interpretability\n- **Molinari et al. 2025**: Emergent world representations in OpenVLA\n- **Karamcheti et al. 2024 (Prismatic)**: OpenVLA's architectural foundation, must cite\n","numLines":152,"startLine":1,"totalLines":152}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QhXiXfnxgYvAPkBVUTY3Wv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"核心 RSA 三方对比，证明 action-relevant 结构源自 frozen vision encoder\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.615,\n7\t      \"trained_with_inst_rsa\": 0.501,\n8\t      \"untrained_with_inst_rsa\": 0.485,\n9\t      \"trained_no_inst_rsa\": 0.501,\n10\t      \"untrained_no_inst_rsa\": 0.48,\n11\t      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388\n12\t    },\n13\t    \"tables\": [\n14\t      {\n15\t        \"title\": \"Table 1: RSA with Action Structure (image_mean aggregation)\",\n16\t        \"rows\": [\n17\t          [\n18\t            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n19\t            \"0.615\",\n20\t            \"—\"\n21\t          ],\n22\t          [\n23\t            \"VLA trained (with-inst)\",\n24\t            \"0.501\",\n25\t            \"Peak L23\"\n26\t          ],\n27\t          [\n28\t            \"VLA untrained (with-inst)\",\n29\t            \"0.485\",\n30\t            \"Peak L23\"\n31\t          ],\n32\t          [\n33\t            \"VLA trained (no-inst)\",\n34\t            \"0.501\",\n35\t            \"Peak L23\"\n36\t          ],\n37\t          [\n38\t            \"VLA untrained (no-inst)\",\n39\t            \"0.480\",\n40\t            \"Peak L29\"\n41\t          ],\n42\t          [\n43\t            \"CLIP-ViT (plan_012)\",\n44\t            \"0.46\",\n45\t            \"Median tier prediction\"\n46\t          ],\n47\t          [\n48\t            \"DINOv2\",\n49\t            \"0.388\",\n50\t            \"Vision-only baseline\"\n51\t          ]\n52\t        ]\n53\t      }\n54\t    ],\n55\t    \"figures\": [],\n56\t    \"analysis\": \"SigLIP 优势明确但在 median 档下需要 CLIP-ViT 数据来区分 \\\"VL pretraining 通用贡献\\\" vs \\\"SigLIP  specific 优势\\\"。CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46 表明 VL pretraining 贡献约 0.07 RSA（0.46-0.388=DINO）， 而 SigLIP 在此基础上额外贡献 0.155（0.615-0.46）。这迫使 Claim 1 承认 encoder choice matters。\\n\\n\\n已完成实验，实际数据直接沿用。SigLIP RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 各条件（~0.48-0.50）和 DINO（0.388）， 在 median 档下此结果本身不受挑战。但因 plan_012 CLIP-ViT 控制实验将揭示 SigLIP 优势部分来自  encoder-specific 因素（而非纯 VL pretraining），Claim 1 需从 \\\"vision encoder dominance\\\"  软化为 \\\"VL-pretrained encoder dominance, with SigLIP showing strongest alignment\\\"。 核心论点（action structure 源自 frozen encoder 而非 LLM fine-tuning）不变，但不能声称任意  VL encoder 都能达到 SigLIP 水平。\\n\"\n57\t  },\n58\t  {\n59\t    \"name\": \"DINO baseline RSA\",\n60\t    \"description\": \"Standalone vision model 参照基线\",\n61\t    \"results\": {\n62\t      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n63\t      \"per_task_rho_mean\": 0.901,\n64\t      \"action_probe_R2\": 0.712\n65\t    },\n66\t    \"tables\": [],\n67\t    \"figures\": [],\n68\t    \"analysis\": \"DINO 数据在 median 档下与 CLIP-ViT 共同支撑 \\\"pretraining recipe matters\\\" 论点。 DINO ≈ Projector in R² but << in RSA 的 dissociation 是核心 insight。\\n\\n\\n已完成。DINO RSA=0.388 作为 lower bound 在 median 档下更为重要：CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46  意味着 DINO-to-CLIP gap（0.07）远小于 CLIP-to-SigLIP gap（0.155），说明 VL pretraining  是必要条件但 SigLIP 的具体 recipe 贡献更大。同时 DINO action probe R²=0.712 ≈ Projector  0.706（p=0.22, n.s.）的发现在 median 档下成为关键区分论据：action information 的 presence  与 geometric alignment 是不同维度。\\n\"\n69\t  },\n70\t  {\n71\t    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\",\n72\t    \"description\": \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的衰减轨迹\",\n73\t    \"results\": {\n74\t      \"proj_to_l1_drop_range\": [\n75\t        0.137,\n76\t        0.253\n77\t      ],\n78\t      \"total_degradation\": 0.13,\n79\t      \"pattern\": \"non-monotonic with partial recovery in mid-layers\",\n80\t      \"all_layers_above_dino\": true\n81\t    },\n82\t    \"tables\": [\n83\t      {\n84\t        \"title\": \"Table S1: Per-layer RSA summary\",\n85\t        \"rows\": [\n86\t          [\n87\t            \"Condition\",\n88\t            \"Peak RSA\",\n89\t            \"Peak Layer\",\n90\t            \"Proj→L1 Drop\"\n91\t          ],\n92\t          [\n93\t            \"trained with-inst\",\n94\t            \"0.488\",\n95\t            \"L9\",\n96\t            \"0.204\"\n97\t          ],\n98\t          [\n99\t            \"untrained with-inst\",\n100\t            \"0.485\",\n101\t            \"L12\",\n102\t            \"0.151\"\n103\t          ],\n104\t          [\n105\t            \"trained no-inst\",\n106\t            \"0.489\",\n107\t            \"L30\",\n108\t            \"0.253\"\n109\t          ],\n110\t          [\n111\t            \"untrained no-inst\",\n112\t            \"0.480\",\n113\t            \"L6\",\n114\t            \"0.137\"\n115\t          ]\n116\t        ]\n117\t      }\n118\t    ],\n119\t    \"figures\": [],\n120\t    \"analysis\": \"Per-layer curve 稳定，median 档不影响此结果。在 rebuttal 中可作为 mechanical evidence  支撑 \\\"LLM as information router\\\" 叙事。\\n\\n\\n已完成。Proj→L1 drop 20-40% 的 non-monotonic pattern 在 median 档下不受挑战。 此 curve 对 median 档叙事有额外价值：即使 LLM 降解 geometric alignment，所有层 RSA  仍 >> DINO（0.388），说明 SigLIP 的 geometric structure 虽被衰减但未被摧毁。这支撑  \\\"VL pretraining 注入的结构具有 robustness\\\" 的 discussion point。\\n\"\n121\t  },\n122\t  {\n123\t    \"name\": \"Output head analysis\",\n124\t    \"description\": \"确认 SigLIP+projector frozen，LLM 权重变化分布\",\n125\t    \"results\": {\n126\t      \"vision_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n127\t      \"projector_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n128\t      \"llm_mean_rel_change\": 1.316,\n129\t      \"llm_cos_sim\": 0.218,\n130\t      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12\n131\t    },\n132\t    \"tables\": [],\n133\t    \"figures\": [],\n134\t    \"analysis\": \"此结果在所有档位都成立，为 \\\"routing-not-creating\\\" 提供 architectural grounding。\\n\\n\\n已完成。Vision backbone + Projector 完全 frozen（cos_sim=1.0）是 Claims 1-3 的结构性  前提。在 median 档下此结果 critical：它解释了为什么 trained ≈ untrained in representation  structure——因为 action-relevant structure 的源头（SigLIP+projector）在 training 中完全  不变。LLM 权重变化均匀分布（1.22-1.37）而非 head-concentrated，说明 fine-tuning 是  distributed adaptation 而非 shallow head tuning。\\n\"\n135\t  },\n136\t  {\n137\t    \"name\": \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks\",\n138\t    \"description\": \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained across multiple methods\",\n139\t    \"results\": {\n140\t      \"all_methods_consistent\": true,\n141\t      \"trained_approx_untrained\": true,\n142\t      \"both_above_dino\": true\n143\t    },\n144\t    \"tables\": [],\n145\t    \"figures\": [],\n146\t    \"analysis\": \"此实验的核心发现已由其他实验独立覆盖。Median 档下 reviewer 更可能质疑  single-architecture 而非 method coverage。\\n\\n\\nOrphaned 状态但已由 plan_001/006/007/008/011/009 的各独立实验覆盖。在 median 档下， 核心发现 \\\"trained ≈ untrained\\\" 来自 image_mean RSA（bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20） 和 functional probe（image_mean R² gap 稳定）。单独的 6-method 矩阵不影响 median 档  判断。如果 reviewer 质疑 method coverage，已有 RSA + CKA + functional probe +  bootstrap CI 四重交叉验证。\\n\"\n147\t  },\n148\t  {\n149\t    \"name\": \"Instruction ablation\",\n150\t    \"description\": \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\",\n151\t    \"results\": {\n152\t      \"delta_with_minus_no_inst\": 0.004,\n153\t      \"no_inst_untrained_rsa\": 0.48,\n154\t      \"instruction_effect\": \"negligible\"\n155\t    },\n156\t    \"tables\": [],\n157\t    \"figures\": [],\n158\t    \"analysis\": \"Instruction invariance 是 Claim 3 最 robust 的子发现，median 档完全不影响。\\n\\n\\n已完成。Δ=0.004 远低于任何合理阈值。在 median 档下此结果与 plan_008（random/shuffled  instruction）共同构成三重不变性证据（training × instruction presence × instruction content）， 这是 Claim 3 最完备的支撑之一且不受 median 档的 confound 影响。与 Hou 2026 LangGap /  Fei 2025 LIBERO-Plus 的 behavioral finding（VLAs ignore language）形成 representation-level  解释。\\n\"\n159\t  },\n160\t  {\n161\t    \"name\": \"2×2 matrix (training × instruction)\",\n162\t    \"description\": \"四条件全收敛验证\",\n163\t    \"results\": {\n164\t      \"all_cells_range\": [\n165\t        0.48,\n166\t        0.501\n167\t      ],\n168\t      \"bootstrap_ci\": \"[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0\",\n169\t      \"training_effect_p\": 0.2\n170\t    },\n171\t    \"tables\": [\n172\t      {\n173\t        \"title\": \"Table 2: 2×2 Training × Instruction RSA Matrix (image_mean)\",\n174\t        \"rows\": [\n175\t          [\n176\t            \"\",\n177\t            \"With Instruction\",\n178\t            \"No Instruction\"\n179\t          ],\n180\t          [\n181\t            \"Trained\",\n182\t            \"0.501\",\n183\t            \"0.501\"\n184\t          ],\n185\t          [\n186\t            \"Untrained\",\n187\t            \"0.485\",\n188\t            \"0.480\"\n189\t          ],\n190\t          [\n191\t            \"Bootstrap Δ CI\",\n192\t            \"[-0.058, 0.072]\",\n193\t            \"p=0.20\"\n194\t          ]\n195\t        ]\n196\t      }\n197\t    ],\n198\t    \"figures\": [],\n199\t    \"analysis\": \"此 2×2 matrix 是论文 Figure 2 或 3 的核心。Median 档下配合 readout concentration  对比使用效果最强。\\n\\n\\n已完成。四条件收敛于 0.48-0.50 band 是 Claim 3（training invariance of distributed  representations）的核心证据。Bootstrap CI 包含 0、p=0.20 表明 training effect 在统计上  不显著。在 median 档下此结果与 readout concentration（Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）形成鲜明对比—— 这正是 \\\"routing-not-creating\\\" 叙事的关键 dissociation：distributed structure 不变  但 readout 集中度训练依赖。此 contrast 在 median 档下作为 headline result 前置。\\n\"\n200\t  },\n201\t  {\n202\t    \"name\": \"Random instruction control\",\n203\t    \"description\": \"随机/无意义 instruction 验证 content 不影响 RSA\",\n204\t    \"results\": {\n205\t      \"normal_rsa\": 0.489,\n206\t      \"random_rsa\": 0.484,\n207\t      \"shuffled_rsa\": 0.483,\n208\t      \"empty_rsa\": 0.472,\n209\t      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.017,\n210\t      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n211\t    },\n212\t    \"tables\": [\n213\t      {\n214\t        \"title\": \"Table S2: Instruction Content Invariance\",\n215\t        \"rows\": [\n216\t          [\n217\t            \"Condition\",\n218\t            \"Peak RSA\",\n219\t            \"Δ vs Normal\"\n220\t          ],\n221\t          [\n222\t            \"Normal instruction\",\n223\t            \"0.489\",\n224\t            \"—\"\n225\t          ],\n226\t          [\n227\t            \"Random words\",\n228\t            \"0.484\",\n229\t            \"-0.005\"\n230\t          ],\n231\t          [\n232\t            \"Shuffled tokens\",\n233\t            \"0.483\",\n234\t            \"-0.006\"\n235\t          ],\n236\t          [\n237\t            \"Empty string\",\n238\t            \"0.472\",\n239\t            \"-0.017\"\n240\t          ]\n241\t        ]\n242\t      }\n243\t    ],\n244\t    \"figures\": [],\n245\t    \"analysis\": \"Empty 略低（-0.017）可能反映 token sequence length 对 attention pattern 的微弱影响， 但量级远不足以影响任何 claim。\\n\\n\\n已完成。四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）RSA 在 ±0.017 内， 排除 trivial separability 攻击面。在 median 档下此结果关闭了 \\\"instruction content  可能通过 representation 影响 action\\\" 的假说——所有变异性 << training effect（本身就  不显著, p=0.20），更 << SigLIP→LLM degradation（0.114）。三重不变性完备。\\n\"\n246\t  },\n247\t  {\n248\t    \"name\": \"Functional action probe (v2 with bootstrap + DINO three-way)\",\n249\t    \"description\": \"Projector / LLM / DINO 功能性对比，bootstrap CI\",\n250\t    \"results\": {\n251\t      \"projector_R2\": 0.706,\n252\t      \"image_mean_trained_L19_R2\": 0.683,\n253\t      \"last_preaction_trained_L19_R2\": 0.731,\n254\t      \"untrained_image_mean_L0_R2\": 0.714,\n255\t      \"untrained_last_preaction_L32_R2\": 0.686,\n256\t      \"dino_R2\": 0.712,\n257\t      \"bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_p\": 0.001,\n258\t      \"bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_ci\": [\n259\t        0.011,\n260\t        0.037\n261\t      ],\n262\t      \"readout_concentration_delta\": 0.045,\n263\t      \"readout_concentration_p\": 0.0001,\n264\t      \"readout_concentration_ci\": [\n265\t        0.032,\n266\t        0.058\n267\t      ]\n268\t    },\n269\t    \"tables\": [\n270\t      {\n271\t        \"title\": \"Table 3: Functional Action Probe R² (LIBERO-Goal)\",\n272\t        \"rows\": [\n273\t          [\n274\t            \"Model/Condition\",\n275\t            \"mean R²\",\n276\t            \"vs Projector\",\n277\t            \"p-value\"\n278\t          ],\n279\t          [\n280\t            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n281\t            \"0.706\",\n282\t            \"—\",\n283\t            \"—\"\n284\t          ],\n285\t          [\n286\t            \"Trained image_mean L19\",\n287\t            \"0.683\",\n288\t            \"-0.023\",\n289\t            \"0.001\"\n290\t          ],\n291\t          [\n292\t            \"Trained last_preaction L19\",\n293\t            \"0.731\",\n294\t            \"+0.025\",\n295\t            \"0.001\"\n296\t          ],\n297\t          [\n298\t            \"Untrained image_mean L0\",\n299\t            \"0.714\",\n300\t            \"+0.008\",\n301\t            \"n.s.\"\n302\t          ],\n303\t          [\n304\t            \"Untrained last_preaction L32\",\n305\t            \"0.686\",\n306\t            \"-0.020\",\n307\t            \"<0.0001 vs trained\"\n308\t          ],\n309\t          [\n310\t            \"DINOv2 cls_token\",\n311\t            \"0.712\",\n312\t            \"+0.006\",\n313\t            \"0.22 (n.s.)\"\n314\t          ]\n315\t        ]\n316\t      }\n317\t    ],\n318\t    \"figures\": [],\n319\t    \"analysis\": \"Readout concentration 是 median 档论文的核心卖点。此 Δ=0.045 (p<0.0001) 与  image_mean RSA Δ=0.02 (p=0.20) 的 contrast 完美支撑 \\\"routing-not-creating\\\"： training 改变 information flow 但不改变 distributed structure。\\n\\n\\n已完成（orphaned 但各子实验均 DONE）。在 median 档下此结果是最强证据：\\n(1) Readout concentration（trained 0.731 >> untrained 0.686, Δ=0.045, p<0.0001） 完全不受 CLIP-ViT confound 和 LIBERO-Spatial 延迟影响，因为它测量的是 LLM internal  routing behavior 而非 encoder quality。\\n(2) Three-way ordering DINO(0.712) ≈ Proj(0.706) > LLM image_mean(0.683) 在  median 档下成为关键 nuance：action information 的 presence 是 encoder-agnostic 的  （DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²），但 geometric alignment（RSA）是 encoder-specific 的。 这支撑 median 档的论文叙事调整——从 \\\"where actions come from\\\" 到 \\\"what fine-tuning  actually learns\\\"。\\n(3) Untrained readout 0.686 < projector 0.706 证明 redistribution 需要 training， 这是 \\\"routing is learned\\\" 的 smoking gun，且在 median 档下作为 headline result  前置不受任何 confound 影响。\\n\"\n320\t  },\n321\t  {\n322\t    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\",\n323\t    \"description\": \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 通用贡献 vs SigLIP-specific 优势\",\n324\t    \"results\": {\n325\t      \"clip_vit_rsa_image_mean\": 0.46,\n326\t      \"clip_vit_rsa_95ci\": [\n327\t        0.38,\n328\t        0.54\n329\t      ],\n330\t      \"clip_vit_rsa_per_task_range\": [\n331\t        0.35,\n332\t        0.58\n333\t      ],\n334\t      \"clip_vit_action_probe_R2\": 0.695,\n335\t      \"clip_vit_action_delta_R2\": 0.11,\n336\t      \"clip_vit_vs_dino_rsa_delta\": 0.072,\n337\t      \"clip_vit_vs_siglip_rsa_delta\": -0.155,\n338\t      \"clip_vit_vs_projector_probe_delta\": -0.011,\n339\t      \"ordering_rsa\": \"SigLIP (0.615) >> CLIP-ViT (0.46) > DINO (0.388)\",\n340\t      \"ordering_R2\": \"DINO (0.712) ≈ Proj (0.706) ≈ CLIP-ViT (0.695) > LLM img_mean (0.683)\"\n341\t    },\n342\t    \"tables\": [\n343\t      {\n344\t        \"title\": \"Table 4: Pretraining Control — CLIP-ViT vs SigLIP vs DINO\",\n345\t        \"rows\": [\n346\t          [\n347\t            \"Encoder\",\n348\t            \"RSA (ρ)\",\n349\t            \"Action R²\",\n350\t            \"Pretraining\"\n351\t          ],\n352\t          [\n353\t            \"SigLIP-SO400M\",\n354\t            \"0.615\",\n355\t            \"0.706\",\n356\t            \"Sigmoid image-text (WebLI)\"\n357\t          ],\n358\t          [\n359\t            \"CLIP ViT-L/14\",\n360\t            \"0.46\",\n361\t            \"0.695\",\n362\t            \"Softmax image-text (WIT/LAION)\"\n363\t          ],\n364\t          [\n365\t            \"DINOv2 ViT-L\",\n366\t            \"0.388\",\n367\t            \"0.712\",\n368\t            \"Self-supervised (LVD-142M)\"\n369\t          ]\n370\t        ]\n371\t      },\n372\t      {\n373\t        \"title\": \"Table 4b: Decomposition of VL-pretraining contribution\",\n374\t        \"rows\": [\n375\t          [\n376\t            \"Comparison\",\n377\t            \"ΔRSA\",\n378\t            \"ΔR²\",\n379\t            \"Interpretation\"\n380\t          ],\n381\t          [\n382\t            \"CLIP - DINO\",\n383\t            \"+0.072\",\n384\t            \"-0.017\",\n385\t            \"VL pretraining adds geometric alignment, not information\"\n386\t          ],\n387\t          [\n388\t            \"SigLIP - CLIP\",\n389\t            \"+0.155\",\n390\t            \"+0.011\",\n391\t            \"SigLIP recipe adds both alignment and information\"\n392\t          ],\n393\t          [\n394\t            \"SigLIP - DINO\",\n395\t            \"+0.227\",\n396\t            \"-0.006\",\n397\t            \"Total VL advantage is geometric, not functional\"\n398\t          ]\n399\t        ]\n400\t      }\n401\t    ],\n402\t    \"figures\": [],\n403\t    \"analysis\": \"CLIP-ViT 中间结果在 median 档下是 double-edged sword：\\n正面：(1) 确认 VL pretraining 有贡献（CLIP > DINO in RSA），支撑 \\\"VL pretraining  matters\\\" 叙事。(2) R² 三者接近进一步强化 geometric-functional dissociation finding。 (3) 为 \\\"pretraining recipe matters\\\" discussion 提供具体数据点。\\n负面：(1) SigLIP 优势部分来自 encoder-specific 因素，削弱 \\\"VL pretraining is the key\\\"  的通用性声明。(2) 至少一位 reviewer 会质疑：如果换成 CLIP-ViT，VLA 的 action structure  会怎样变化？需要 rebuttal 准备 CLIP-ViT as VLA backbone 的讨论（即使不做实验）。\\nRebuttal 策略：将 CLIP-ViT 结果定位为 \\\"partial support + new insight\\\"——VL pretraining  是 necessary but not sufficient condition for strong geometric alignment，SigLIP  recipe 的具体优势值得 future work 深入研究。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档核心假设：CLIP-ViT RSA 落入 0.42-0.50 中间地带。\\n为什么 RSA ~0.46（高于 DINO 但低于 SigLIP）： - CLIP-ViT（ViT-L/14, 400M params）与 DINO 共享 pure vision architecture，\\n  但 CLIP 的 contrastive image-text pretraining 赋予了部分 language-aligned geometric \\n  structure，使其 RSA 高于 self-supervised DINO（0.388）。\\n- 然而 SigLIP 相比 CLIP 有三个关键差异：(a) sigmoid loss vs softmax loss——SigLIP \\n  的 pairwise sigmoid 更好地保留 fine-grained distance structure；(b) training \\n  data scale（WebLI vs WIT/LAION）；(c) 可能的 architecture tuning。这些差异解释了 \\n  SigLIP 额外的 0.155 RSA 优势。\\n- Action probe R² ~0.695 与 SigLIP projector（0.706）接近但略低，说明 VL pretraining \\n  的 contribution 主要在 geometric alignment（RSA）而非 raw information content（R²），\\n  与 DINO ≈ Projector in R² 的发现一致。\\n\\n此结果的 implication： - Claim 1 必须限定：不是所有 VL-pretrained encoder 都达到 SigLIP 水平的 geometric \\n  alignment。存在 encoder hierarchy：SigLIP > CLIP > DINO。\\n- 但核心论点不变：即使 RSA=0.46 的 CLIP-ViT，其 geometric alignment 仍高于 VLA \\n  各条件（0.48-0.50 LLM degrades it further），且远高于 DINO。\\n- \\\"Pretraining recipe matters\\\" 是新增 discussion point，不是对 core claims 的否定。\\n\"\n404\t  },\n405\t  {\n406\t    \"name\": \"CKA verification\",\n407\t    \"description\": \"CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检查指标依赖性\",\n408\t    \"results\": {\n409\t      \"linear_cka_ordering\": \"untrained (0.089) > trained (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\",\n410\t      \"rdm_cka_ordering\": \"trained (0.260) ≈ projector (0.257) > untrained (0.246) > DINO (0.241)\",\n411\t      \"cka_last_preaction\": 0.127,\n412\t      \"rsa_cka_ordering_reversal\": true\n413\t    },\n414\t    \"tables\": [\n415\t      {\n416\t        \"title\": \"Table S3: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\",\n417\t        \"rows\": [\n418\t          [\n419\t            \"Metric\",\n420\t            \"Ordering\",\n421\t            \"Interpretation\"\n422\t          ],\n423\t          [\n424\t            \"RSA\",\n425\t            \"Proj > Trained > Untrained > DINO\",\n426\t            \"Geometric alignment with action space\"\n427\t          ],\n428\t          [\n429\t            \"Linear CKA\",\n430\t            \"Untrained > Trained > Proj > DINO\",\n431\t            \"Global structure preservation\"\n432\t          ],\n433\t          [\n434\t            \"RDM-CKA\",\n435\t            \"Trained ≈ Proj > Untrained > DINO\",\n436\t            \"Hybrid (distance-based CKA)\"\n437\t          ]\n438\t        ]\n439\t      }\n440\t    ],\n441\t    \"figures\": [],\n442\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档下需在 main text Discussion 正面讨论此 dissociation（不能只放 supplementary）。 一位 reviewer 的 \\\"metric confusion\\\" 评价需正面回应：dissociation 恰恰说明 LLM 对  representation 的变换是 selective 的——降解 local geometry 但保留 global structure—— 这对理解 LLM 的 representation processing 有独立价值。\\n\\n\\n已完成。在 median 档下此结果面临额外挑战：至少一位 reviewer 将 CKA-RSA dissociation  视为 metric confusion 而非 finding。\\n为什么 CKA 和 RSA 排序反转： - RSA 测量 pairwise distance structure 的 rank correlation——local geometric alignment。\\n  LLM 的 nonlinear transformation 打乱了 pairwise distances 的 rank order，降低 RSA。\\n- CKA 测量 centered kernel alignment——global subspace overlap。LLM 保留甚至增强了 \\n  global variance structure（特别是 CKA 单调上升 L0→L32），因为 attention 操作虽然 \\n  重排 pairwise distances 但保留了 principal variation directions。\\n- 这不是 \\\"metric confusion\\\"——两个指标测量不同 aspects of representational similarity，\\n  dissociation 本身是 informative 的。但 median 档的 reviewer 可能不接受这个区分。\\n\\nRebuttal 准备： - 明确定义 \\\"geometric alignment\\\" (RSA) vs \\\"structural preservation\\\" (CKA) - 引用 Kornblith et al. 2019 和 Shahbazi et al. 2021 对两指标 sensitivity 差异的分析 - 强调 Claim 2 已限定为 \\\"geometric (RSA) degradation\\\"，不泛化为 \\\"representation quality\\\" - CKA last_preaction=0.127 >> image_mean 0.08x 支撑 redistribution，与 RSA 一致\\n\"\n443\t  },\n444\t  {\n445\t    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark\",\n446\t    \"description\": \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证所有 Claims\",\n447\t    \"results\": {\n448\t      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.52,\n449\t      \"siglip_projector_rsa_95ci\": [\n450\t        0.45,\n451\t        0.58\n452\t      ],\n453\t      \"trained_image_mean_rsa_peak\": 0.42,\n454\t      \"trained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 19,\n455\t      \"untrained_image_mean_rsa_peak\": 0.4,\n456\t      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 23,\n457\t      \"dino_rsa\": 0.32,\n458\t      \"training_effect_delta\": 0.02,\n459\t      \"training_effect_p\": 0.08,\n460\t      \"training_effect_significant\": false,\n461\t      \"readout_trained_R2\": 0.68,\n462\t      \"readout_untrained_R2\": 0.655,\n463\t      \"readout_delta\": 0.025,\n464\t      \"readout_delta_ci\": [\n465\t        0.015,\n466\t        0.035\n467\t      ],\n468\t      \"readout_delta_p\": 0.01,\n469\t      \"action_probe_projector_R2\": 0.65,\n470\t      \"action_probe_llm_image_mean_R2\": 0.62,\n471\t      \"ordering_preserved\": true,\n472\t      \"effect_size_reduction\": \"35-45%\"\n473\t    },\n474\t    \"tables\": [\n475\t      {\n476\t        \"title\": \"Table S4: LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation\",\n477\t        \"rows\": [\n478\t          [\n479\t            \"Condition\",\n480\t            \"RSA (Spatial)\",\n481\t            \"RSA (Goal)\",\n482\t            \"Reduction\"\n483\t          ],\n484\t          [\n485\t            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n486\t            \"0.52\",\n487\t            \"0.615\",\n488\t            \"-15%\"\n489\t          ],\n490\t          [\n491\t            \"Trained image_mean\",\n492\t            \"0.42\",\n493\t            \"0.501\",\n494\t            \"-16%\"\n495\t          ],\n496\t          [\n497\t            \"Untrained image_mean\",\n498\t            \"0.40\",\n499\t            \"0.485\",\n500\t            \"-18%\"\n501\t          ],\n502\t          [\n503\t            \"DINOv2\",\n504\t            \"0.32\",\n505\t            \"0.388\",\n506\t            \"-18%\"\n507\t          ],\n508\t          [\n509\t            \"Training Δ\",\n510\t            \"0.02 (p=0.08)\",\n511\t            \"0.02 (p=0.20)\",\n512\t            \"direction consistent\"\n513\t          ]\n514\t        ]\n515\t      },\n516\t      {\n517\t        \"title\": \"Table S5: Readout Concentration Cross-Benchmark\",\n518\t        \"rows\": [\n519\t          [\n520\t            \"Metric\",\n521\t            \"Spatial\",\n522\t            \"Goal\",\n523\t            \"Reduction\"\n524\t          ],\n525\t          [\n526\t            \"Trained readout R²\",\n527\t            \"0.68\",\n528\t            \"0.731\",\n529\t            \"-7%\"\n530\t          ],\n531\t          [\n532\t            \"Untrained readout R²\",\n533\t            \"0.655\",\n534\t            \"0.686\",\n535\t            \"-5%\"\n536\t          ],\n537\t          [\n538\t            \"Δ (trained-untrained)\",\n539\t            \"0.025\",\n540\t            \"0.045\",\n541\t            \"-44%\"\n542\t          ],\n543\t          [\n544\t            \"p-value\",\n545\t            \"0.01\",\n546\t            \"<0.0001\",\n547\t            \"still significant\"\n548\t          ]\n549\t        ]\n550\t      }\n551\t    ],\n552\t    \"figures\": [],\n553\t    \"analysis\": \"LIBERO-Spatial 部分复现在 median 档下是可接受的：ordering 保持证明 findings 非  benchmark-specific artifact，effect size 缩小说明 task characteristics（spatial vs  object-centric）调节了具体 magnitude。这实际上增加了论文的 nuance 和 ecological  validity。\\n关键 rebuttal 点：effect size 缩小是 expected 的（spatial relationships 更难）， ordering preservation 才是 generalizability 的 test。如果连 ordering 都不保持  那才是 real concern。\\n如果未完成：在 paper Discussion 加 \\\"ongoing cross-benchmark validation\\\" 一段， rebuttal letter 提供 extraction pipeline 进度 + 初步 RSA numbers。Reviewer  通常接受 \\\"data in preparation\\\" 如果方向一致且 pipeline 可信。\\n\\nMedian 档核心假设：LIBERO-Spatial 未完成或部分复现，effect size 缩小 30-50%。\\n为什么 effect size 缩小： - LIBERO-Spatial 的 action structure 比 LIBERO-Goal 更 spatially grounded——task \\n  差异主要在 spatial prepositions（\\\"to the left of\\\", \\\"in front of\\\"）而非 object \\n  identity。SigLIP 的 image-text pretraining 对 spatial relationships 的 encoding \\n  不如对 object-level semantics 那么强，因此 RSA 从 0.615 降至 ~0.52。\\n- Training effect 在 LIBERO-Spatial 上 p=0.08（边缘），因为 spatial tasks 的 action \\n  variability 更高，增加了 bootstrap sampling 的 variance。但 CI 仍然覆盖 0 或 \\n  接近覆盖 0，不改变 Claim 3 的方向性结论。\\n- Readout concentration Δ=0.025（vs LIBERO-Goal 0.045）缩小约 44%，但仍显著 \\n  (p=0.01)。缩小原因：spatial tasks 的 action prediction 难度更高，readout \\n  concentration 的 ceiling effect 降低。\\n- DINO RSA 也降至 0.32（vs 0.388 on LIBERO-Goal），说明 spatial tasks 对所有 \\n  encoder 都更难 align。\\n\\n此结果的 implication： - 所有三个 Claims 的 ordering 保持（SigLIP > VLA > DINO; trained ≈ untrained in \\n  distributed; trained > untrained in readout），但 effect size 一致缩小。\\n- 论文需在所有 Claims 加 \\\"on LIBERO-Goal\\\" 限定，LIBERO-Spatial 作为 partial \\n  replication 放在 supplementary 或 discussion。\\n- 如果 deadline 前未完成：rebuttal 中 promise LIBERO-Spatial 初步结果，附现有 \\n  extraction pipeline 的进度证据。\\n\"\n554\t  }\n555\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b183a6b-c63b-4393-92da-16558ac7b845","uuid":"b3c08311-1e1c-4fe9-8242-a4996e6e1ff5","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:32:42.055Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T011810/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\",\n    \"description\": \"核心 RSA 三方对比，证明 action-relevant 结构源自 frozen vision encoder\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.615,\n      \"trained_with_inst_rsa\": 0.501,\n      \"untrained_with_inst_rsa\": 0.485,\n      \"trained_no_inst_rsa\": 0.501,\n      \"untrained_no_inst_rsa\": 0.48,\n      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 1: RSA with Action Structure (image_mean aggregation)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA trained (with-inst)\",\n            \"0.501\",\n            \"Peak L23\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA untrained (with-inst)\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"Peak L23\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA trained (no-inst)\",\n            \"0.501\",\n            \"Peak L23\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA untrained (no-inst)\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"Peak L29\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLIP-ViT (plan_012)\",\n            \"0.46\",\n            \"Median tier prediction\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINOv2\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"Vision-only baseline\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SigLIP 优势明确但在 median 档下需要 CLIP-ViT 数据来区分 \\\"VL pretraining 通用贡献\\\" vs \\\"SigLIP  specific 优势\\\"。CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46 表明 VL pretraining 贡献约 0.07 RSA（0.46-0.388=DINO）， 而 SigLIP 在此基础上额外贡献 0.155（0.615-0.46）。这迫使 Claim 1 承认 encoder choice matters。\\n\\n\\n已完成实验，实际数据直接沿用。SigLIP RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 各条件（~0.48-0.50）和 DINO（0.388）， 在 median 档下此结果本身不受挑战。但因 plan_012 CLIP-ViT 控制实验将揭示 SigLIP 优势部分来自  encoder-specific 因素（而非纯 VL pretraining），Claim 1 需从 \\\"vision encoder dominance\\\"  软化为 \\\"VL-pretrained encoder dominance, with SigLIP showing strongest alignment\\\"。 核心论点（action structure 源自 frozen encoder 而非 LLM fine-tuning）不变，但不能声称任意  VL encoder 都能达到 SigLIP 水平。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DINO baseline RSA\",\n    \"description\": \"Standalone vision model 参照基线\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n      \"per_task_rho_mean\": 0.901,\n      \"action_probe_R2\": 0.712\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DINO 数据在 median 档下与 CLIP-ViT 共同支撑 \\\"pretraining recipe matters\\\" 论点。 DINO ≈ Projector in R² but << in RSA 的 dissociation 是核心 insight。\\n\\n\\n已完成。DINO RSA=0.388 作为 lower bound 在 median 档下更为重要：CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46  意味着 DINO-to-CLIP gap（0.07）远小于 CLIP-to-SigLIP gap（0.155），说明 VL pretraining  是必要条件但 SigLIP 的具体 recipe 贡献更大。同时 DINO action probe R²=0.712 ≈ Projector  0.706（p=0.22, n.s.）的发现在 median 档下成为关键区分论据：action information 的 presence  与 geometric alignment 是不同维度。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\",\n    \"description\": \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的衰减轨迹\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"proj_to_l1_drop_range\": [\n        0.137,\n        0.253\n      ],\n      \"total_degradation\": 0.13,\n      \"pattern\": \"non-monotonic with partial recovery in mid-layers\",\n      \"all_layers_above_dino\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table S1: Per-layer RSA summary\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Condition\",\n            \"Peak RSA\",\n            \"Peak Layer\",\n            \"Proj→L1 Drop\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"trained with-inst\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"L9\",\n            \"0.204\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"untrained with-inst\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"L12\",\n            \"0.151\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"trained no-inst\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"L30\",\n            \"0.253\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"untrained no-inst\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"L6\",\n            \"0.137\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Per-layer curve 稳定，median 档不影响此结果。在 rebuttal 中可作为 mechanical evidence  支撑 \\\"LLM as information router\\\" 叙事。\\n\\n\\n已完成。Proj→L1 drop 20-40% 的 non-monotonic pattern 在 median 档下不受挑战。 此 curve 对 median 档叙事有额外价值：即使 LLM 降解 geometric alignment，所有层 RSA  仍 >> DINO（0.388），说明 SigLIP 的 geometric structure 虽被衰减但未被摧毁。这支撑  \\\"VL pretraining 注入的结构具有 robustness\\\" 的 discussion point。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Output head analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"确认 SigLIP+projector frozen，LLM 权重变化分布\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vision_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n      \"projector_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n      \"llm_mean_rel_change\": 1.316,\n      \"llm_cos_sim\": 0.218,\n      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"此结果在所有档位都成立，为 \\\"routing-not-creating\\\" 提供 architectural grounding。\\n\\n\\n已完成。Vision backbone + Projector 完全 frozen（cos_sim=1.0）是 Claims 1-3 的结构性  前提。在 median 档下此结果 critical：它解释了为什么 trained ≈ untrained in representation  structure——因为 action-relevant structure 的源头（SigLIP+projector）在 training 中完全  不变。LLM 权重变化均匀分布（1.22-1.37）而非 head-concentrated，说明 fine-tuning 是  distributed adaptation 而非 shallow head tuning。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks\",\n    \"description\": \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained across multiple methods\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"all_methods_consistent\": true,\n      \"trained_approx_untrained\": true,\n      \"both_above_dino\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"此实验的核心发现已由其他实验独立覆盖。Median 档下 reviewer 更可能质疑  single-architecture 而非 method coverage。\\n\\n\\nOrphaned 状态但已由 plan_001/006/007/008/011/009 的各独立实验覆盖。在 median 档下， 核心发现 \\\"trained ≈ untrained\\\" 来自 image_mean RSA（bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20） 和 functional probe（image_mean R² gap 稳定）。单独的 6-method 矩阵不影响 median 档  判断。如果 reviewer 质疑 method coverage，已有 RSA + CKA + functional probe +  bootstrap CI 四重交叉验证。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Instruction ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"delta_with_minus_no_inst\": 0.004,\n      \"no_inst_untrained_rsa\": 0.48,\n      \"instruction_effect\": \"negligible\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Instruction invariance 是 Claim 3 最 robust 的子发现，median 档完全不影响。\\n\\n\\n已完成。Δ=0.004 远低于任何合理阈值。在 median 档下此结果与 plan_008（random/shuffled  instruction）共同构成三重不变性证据（training × instruction presence × instruction content）， 这是 Claim 3 最完备的支撑之一且不受 median 档的 confound 影响。与 Hou 2026 LangGap /  Fei 2025 LIBERO-Plus 的 behavioral finding（VLAs ignore language）形成 representation-level  解释。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"2×2 matrix (training × instruction)\",\n    \"description\": \"四条件全收敛验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"all_cells_range\": [\n        0.48,\n        0.501\n      ],\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": \"[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0\",\n      \"training_effect_p\": 0.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 2: 2×2 Training × Instruction RSA Matrix (image_mean)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"\",\n            \"With Instruction\",\n            \"No Instruction\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"0.501\",\n            \"0.501\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"0.480\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Bootstrap Δ CI\",\n            \"[-0.058, 0.072]\",\n            \"p=0.20\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"此 2×2 matrix 是论文 Figure 2 或 3 的核心。Median 档下配合 readout concentration  对比使用效果最强。\\n\\n\\n已完成。四条件收敛于 0.48-0.50 band 是 Claim 3（training invariance of distributed  representations）的核心证据。Bootstrap CI 包含 0、p=0.20 表明 training effect 在统计上  不显著。在 median 档下此结果与 readout concentration（Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）形成鲜明对比—— 这正是 \\\"routing-not-creating\\\" 叙事的关键 dissociation：distributed structure 不变  但 readout 集中度训练依赖。此 contrast 在 median 档下作为 headline result 前置。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Random instruction control\",\n    \"description\": \"随机/无意义 instruction 验证 content 不影响 RSA\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"normal_rsa\": 0.489,\n      \"random_rsa\": 0.484,\n      \"shuffled_rsa\": 0.483,\n      \"empty_rsa\": 0.472,\n      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.017,\n      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table S2: Instruction Content Invariance\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Condition\",\n            \"Peak RSA\",\n            \"Δ vs Normal\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Normal instruction\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random words\",\n            \"0.484\",\n            \"-0.005\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Shuffled tokens\",\n            \"0.483\",\n            \"-0.006\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Empty string\",\n            \"0.472\",\n            \"-0.017\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Empty 略低（-0.017）可能反映 token sequence length 对 attention pattern 的微弱影响， 但量级远不足以影响任何 claim。\\n\\n\\n已完成。四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）RSA 在 ±0.017 内， 排除 trivial separability 攻击面。在 median 档下此结果关闭了 \\\"instruction content  可能通过 representation 影响 action\\\" 的假说——所有变异性 << training effect（本身就  不显著, p=0.20），更 << SigLIP→LLM degradation（0.114）。三重不变性完备。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Functional action probe (v2 with bootstrap + DINO three-way)\",\n    \"description\": \"Projector / LLM / DINO 功能性对比，bootstrap CI\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"projector_R2\": 0.706,\n      \"image_mean_trained_L19_R2\": 0.683,\n      \"last_preaction_trained_L19_R2\": 0.731,\n      \"untrained_image_mean_L0_R2\": 0.714,\n      \"untrained_last_preaction_L32_R2\": 0.686,\n      \"dino_R2\": 0.712,\n      \"bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_p\": 0.001,\n      \"bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_ci\": [\n        0.011,\n        0.037\n      ],\n      \"readout_concentration_delta\": 0.045,\n      \"readout_concentration_p\": 0.0001,\n      \"readout_concentration_ci\": [\n        0.032,\n        0.058\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 3: Functional Action Probe R² (LIBERO-Goal)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Model/Condition\",\n            \"mean R²\",\n            \"vs Projector\",\n            \"p-value\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n            \"0.706\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained image_mean L19\",\n            \"0.683\",\n            \"-0.023\",\n            \"0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained last_preaction L19\",\n            \"0.731\",\n            \"+0.025\",\n            \"0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained image_mean L0\",\n            \"0.714\",\n            \"+0.008\",\n            \"n.s.\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained last_preaction L32\",\n            \"0.686\",\n            \"-0.020\",\n            \"<0.0001 vs trained\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 cls_token\",\n            \"0.712\",\n            \"+0.006\",\n            \"0.22 (n.s.)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Readout concentration 是 median 档论文的核心卖点。此 Δ=0.045 (p<0.0001) 与  image_mean RSA Δ=0.02 (p=0.20) 的 contrast 完美支撑 \\\"routing-not-creating\\\"： training 改变 information flow 但不改变 distributed structure。\\n\\n\\n已完成（orphaned 但各子实验均 DONE）。在 median 档下此结果是最强证据：\\n(1) Readout concentration（trained 0.731 >> untrained 0.686, Δ=0.045, p<0.0001） 完全不受 CLIP-ViT confound 和 LIBERO-Spatial 延迟影响，因为它测量的是 LLM internal  routing behavior 而非 encoder quality。\\n(2) Three-way ordering DINO(0.712) ≈ Proj(0.706) > LLM image_mean(0.683) 在  median 档下成为关键 nuance：action information 的 presence 是 encoder-agnostic 的  （DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²），但 geometric alignment（RSA）是 encoder-specific 的。 这支撑 median 档的论文叙事调整——从 \\\"where actions come from\\\" 到 \\\"what fine-tuning  actually learns\\\"。\\n(3) Untrained readout 0.686 < projector 0.706 证明 redistribution 需要 training， 这是 \\\"routing is learned\\\" 的 smoking gun，且在 median 档下作为 headline result  前置不受任何 confound 影响。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\",\n    \"description\": \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 通用贡献 vs SigLIP-specific 优势\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"clip_vit_rsa_image_mean\": 0.46,\n      \"clip_vit_rsa_95ci\": [\n        0.38,\n        0.54\n      ],\n      \"clip_vit_rsa_per_task_range\": [\n        0.35,\n        0.58\n      ],\n      \"clip_vit_action_probe_R2\": 0.695,\n      \"clip_vit_action_delta_R2\": 0.11,\n      \"clip_vit_vs_dino_rsa_delta\": 0.072,\n      \"clip_vit_vs_siglip_rsa_delta\": -0.155,\n      \"clip_vit_vs_projector_probe_delta\": -0.011,\n      \"ordering_rsa\": \"SigLIP (0.615) >> CLIP-ViT (0.46) > DINO (0.388)\",\n      \"ordering_R2\": \"DINO (0.712) ≈ Proj (0.706) ≈ CLIP-ViT (0.695) > LLM img_mean (0.683)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 4: Pretraining Control — CLIP-ViT vs SigLIP vs DINO\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Encoder\",\n            \"RSA (ρ)\",\n            \"Action R²\",\n            \"Pretraining\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP-SO400M\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"0.706\",\n            \"Sigmoid image-text (WebLI)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLIP ViT-L/14\",\n            \"0.46\",\n            \"0.695\",\n            \"Softmax image-text (WIT/LAION)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 ViT-L\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"0.712\",\n            \"Self-supervised (LVD-142M)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 4b: Decomposition of VL-pretraining contribution\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Comparison\",\n            \"ΔRSA\",\n            \"ΔR²\",\n            \"Interpretation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLIP - DINO\",\n            \"+0.072\",\n            \"-0.017\",\n            \"VL pretraining adds geometric alignment, not information\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP - CLIP\",\n            \"+0.155\",\n            \"+0.011\",\n            \"SigLIP recipe adds both alignment and information\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP - DINO\",\n            \"+0.227\",\n            \"-0.006\",\n            \"Total VL advantage is geometric, not functional\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CLIP-ViT 中间结果在 median 档下是 double-edged sword：\\n正面：(1) 确认 VL pretraining 有贡献（CLIP > DINO in RSA），支撑 \\\"VL pretraining  matters\\\" 叙事。(2) R² 三者接近进一步强化 geometric-functional dissociation finding。 (3) 为 \\\"pretraining recipe matters\\\" discussion 提供具体数据点。\\n负面：(1) SigLIP 优势部分来自 encoder-specific 因素，削弱 \\\"VL pretraining is the key\\\"  的通用性声明。(2) 至少一位 reviewer 会质疑：如果换成 CLIP-ViT，VLA 的 action structure  会怎样变化？需要 rebuttal 准备 CLIP-ViT as VLA backbone 的讨论（即使不做实验）。\\nRebuttal 策略：将 CLIP-ViT 结果定位为 \\\"partial support + new insight\\\"——VL pretraining  是 necessary but not sufficient condition for strong geometric alignment，SigLIP  recipe 的具体优势值得 future work 深入研究。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档核心假设：CLIP-ViT RSA 落入 0.42-0.50 中间地带。\\n为什么 RSA ~0.46（高于 DINO 但低于 SigLIP）： - CLIP-ViT（ViT-L/14, 400M params）与 DINO 共享 pure vision architecture，\\n  但 CLIP 的 contrastive image-text pretraining 赋予了部分 language-aligned geometric \\n  structure，使其 RSA 高于 self-supervised DINO（0.388）。\\n- 然而 SigLIP 相比 CLIP 有三个关键差异：(a) sigmoid loss vs softmax loss——SigLIP \\n  的 pairwise sigmoid 更好地保留 fine-grained distance structure；(b) training \\n  data scale（WebLI vs WIT/LAION）；(c) 可能的 architecture tuning。这些差异解释了 \\n  SigLIP 额外的 0.155 RSA 优势。\\n- Action probe R² ~0.695 与 SigLIP projector（0.706）接近但略低，说明 VL pretraining \\n  的 contribution 主要在 geometric alignment（RSA）而非 raw information content（R²），\\n  与 DINO ≈ Projector in R² 的发现一致。\\n\\n此结果的 implication： - Claim 1 必须限定：不是所有 VL-pretrained encoder 都达到 SigLIP 水平的 geometric \\n  alignment。存在 encoder hierarchy：SigLIP > CLIP > DINO。\\n- 但核心论点不变：即使 RSA=0.46 的 CLIP-ViT，其 geometric alignment 仍高于 VLA \\n  各条件（0.48-0.50 LLM degrades it further），且远高于 DINO。\\n- \\\"Pretraining recipe matters\\\" 是新增 discussion point，不是对 core claims 的否定。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CKA verification\",\n    \"description\": \"CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检查指标依赖性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"linear_cka_ordering\": \"untrained (0.089) > trained (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\",\n      \"rdm_cka_ordering\": \"trained (0.260) ≈ projector (0.257) > untrained (0.246) > DINO (0.241)\",\n      \"cka_last_preaction\": 0.127,\n      \"rsa_cka_ordering_reversal\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table S3: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Metric\",\n            \"Ordering\",\n            \"Interpretation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RSA\",\n            \"Proj > Trained > Untrained > DINO\",\n            \"Geometric alignment with action space\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Linear CKA\",\n            \"Untrained > Trained > Proj > DINO\",\n            \"Global structure preservation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RDM-CKA\",\n            \"Trained ≈ Proj > Untrained > DINO\",\n            \"Hybrid (distance-based CKA)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档下需在 main text Discussion 正面讨论此 dissociation（不能只放 supplementary）。 一位 reviewer 的 \\\"metric confusion\\\" 评价需正面回应：dissociation 恰恰说明 LLM 对  representation 的变换是 selective 的——降解 local geometry 但保留 global structure—— 这对理解 LLM 的 representation processing 有独立价值。\\n\\n\\n已完成。在 median 档下此结果面临额外挑战：至少一位 reviewer 将 CKA-RSA dissociation  视为 metric confusion 而非 finding。\\n为什么 CKA 和 RSA 排序反转： - RSA 测量 pairwise distance structure 的 rank correlation——local geometric alignment。\\n  LLM 的 nonlinear transformation 打乱了 pairwise distances 的 rank order，降低 RSA。\\n- CKA 测量 centered kernel alignment——global subspace overlap。LLM 保留甚至增强了 \\n  global variance structure（特别是 CKA 单调上升 L0→L32），因为 attention 操作虽然 \\n  重排 pairwise distances 但保留了 principal variation directions。\\n- 这不是 \\\"metric confusion\\\"——两个指标测量不同 aspects of representational similarity，\\n  dissociation 本身是 informative 的。但 median 档的 reviewer 可能不接受这个区分。\\n\\nRebuttal 准备： - 明确定义 \\\"geometric alignment\\\" (RSA) vs \\\"structural preservation\\\" (CKA) - 引用 Kornblith et al. 2019 和 Shahbazi et al. 2021 对两指标 sensitivity 差异的分析 - 强调 Claim 2 已限定为 \\\"geometric (RSA) degradation\\\"，不泛化为 \\\"representation quality\\\" - CKA last_preaction=0.127 >> image_mean 0.08x 支撑 redistribution，与 RSA 一致\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark\",\n    \"description\": \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证所有 Claims\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.52,\n      \"siglip_projector_rsa_95ci\": [\n        0.45,\n        0.58\n      ],\n      \"trained_image_mean_rsa_peak\": 0.42,\n      \"trained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 19,\n      \"untrained_image_mean_rsa_peak\": 0.4,\n      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 23,\n      \"dino_rsa\": 0.32,\n      \"training_effect_delta\": 0.02,\n      \"training_effect_p\": 0.08,\n      \"training_effect_significant\": false,\n      \"readout_trained_R2\": 0.68,\n      \"readout_untrained_R2\": 0.655,\n      \"readout_delta\": 0.025,\n      \"readout_delta_ci\": [\n        0.015,\n        0.035\n      ],\n      \"readout_delta_p\": 0.01,\n      \"action_probe_projector_R2\": 0.65,\n      \"action_probe_llm_image_mean_R2\": 0.62,\n      \"ordering_preserved\": true,\n      \"effect_size_reduction\": \"35-45%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table S4: LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Condition\",\n            \"RSA (Spatial)\",\n            \"RSA (Goal)\",\n            \"Reduction\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n            \"0.52\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"-15%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained image_mean\",\n            \"0.42\",\n            \"0.501\",\n            \"-16%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained image_mean\",\n            \"0.40\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"-18%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINOv2\",\n            \"0.32\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"-18%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Training Δ\",\n            \"0.02 (p=0.08)\",\n            \"0.02 (p=0.20)\",\n            \"direction consistent\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table S5: Readout Concentration Cross-Benchmark\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Metric\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"Reduction\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained readout R²\",\n            \"0.68\",\n            \"0.731\",\n            \"-7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained readout R²\",\n            \"0.655\",\n            \"0.686\",\n            \"-5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ (trained-untrained)\",\n            \"0.025\",\n            \"0.045\",\n            \"-44%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"p-value\",\n            \"0.01\",\n            \"<0.0001\",\n            \"still significant\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LIBERO-Spatial 部分复现在 median 档下是可接受的：ordering 保持证明 findings 非  benchmark-specific artifact，effect size 缩小说明 task characteristics（spatial vs  object-centric）调节了具体 magnitude。这实际上增加了论文的 nuance 和 ecological  validity。\\n关键 rebuttal 点：effect size 缩小是 expected 的（spatial relationships 更难）， ordering preservation 才是 generalizability 的 test。如果连 ordering 都不保持  那才是 real concern。\\n如果未完成：在 paper Discussion 加 \\\"ongoing cross-benchmark validation\\\" 一段， rebuttal letter 提供 extraction pipeline 进度 + 初步 RSA numbers。Reviewer  通常接受 \\\"data in preparation\\\" 如果方向一致且 pipeline 可信。\\n\\nMedian 档核心假设：LIBERO-Spatial 未完成或部分复现，effect size 缩小 30-50%。\\n为什么 effect size 缩小： - LIBERO-Spatial 的 action structure 比 LIBERO-Goal 更 spatially grounded——task \\n  差异主要在 spatial prepositions（\\\"to the left of\\\", \\\"in front of\\\"）而非 object \\n  identity。SigLIP 的 image-text pretraining 对 spatial relationships 的 encoding \\n  不如对 object-level semantics 那么强，因此 RSA 从 0.615 降至 ~0.52。\\n- Training effect 在 LIBERO-Spatial 上 p=0.08（边缘），因为 spatial tasks 的 action \\n  variability 更高，增加了 bootstrap sampling 的 variance。但 CI 仍然覆盖 0 或 \\n  接近覆盖 0，不改变 Claim 3 的方向性结论。\\n- Readout concentration Δ=0.025（vs LIBERO-Goal 0.045）缩小约 44%，但仍显著 \\n  (p=0.01)。缩小原因：spatial tasks 的 action prediction 难度更高，readout \\n  concentration 的 ceiling effect 降低。\\n- DINO RSA 也降至 0.32（vs 0.388 on LIBERO-Goal），说明 spatial tasks 对所有 \\n  encoder 都更难 align。\\n\\n此结果的 implication： - 所有三个 Claims 的 ordering 保持（SigLIP > VLA > DINO; trained ≈ untrained in \\n  distributed; trained > untrained in readout），但 effect size 一致缩小。\\n- 论文需在所有 Claims 加 \\\"on LIBERO-Goal\\\" 限定，LIBERO-Spatial 作为 partial \\n  replication 放在 supplementary 或 discussion。\\n- 如果 deadline 前未完成：rebuttal 中 promise LIBERO-Spatial 初步结果，附现有 \\n  extraction pipeline 的进度证据。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":555,"startLine":1,"totalLines":555}}}
